served_summary`, and `artifacts` fields for richer reporting.","`cargo fmt --all --check` passes — all code is correctly formatted."],"findings_or_gaps":["CRITICAL: `e2e_validation_suite.rs` test file is entirely missing — no source file exists anywhere in the working tree. It was deleted by commit ed71350 (tanksim-6e5.6.4). The validation_scenarios.md document references `cargo test --test e2e_validation_suite` (line 13) and all 8 scenario cross-references point to `e2e_validation_suite::vsNN_*` functions. The acceptance criterion 'a developer can run the validation suite and get a pass/fail summary for each scenario' is broken.","CRITICAL: `cargo test -p tank_harness` fails to compile due to calibration_report.rs:206 — `ScenarioRow` initialization in `make_row()` is missing 6 fields (`scenario_name`, `domain`, `confidence`, `provenance_status`, `observed_summary`, `artifacts`) that were added to the struct definition. This blocks ALL tank_harness test execution including the new `test_finish_propagates_shared_harness_failures` regression.","Prior stage validation evidence citing '8/8 scenarios passed' cannot be independently verified because the referenced test target no longer exists. The file may have existed during those runs but the current working tree does not support the claims.","CalibrationRun::finish() populates new ScenarioRow fields with empty defaults (empty strings, High confidence, ValidatedDirectionally) rather than accepting them as parameters, meaning all scenarios produced through CalibrationRun go through this path lose their metadata. The richer `ScenarioRow::from_checkpoints()` constructor exists but is not used by CalibrationRun."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["Restore or recreate `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_validation_suite.rs` with the 8 scenario tests referenced in validation_scenarios.md. The file was deleted by commit ed71350 (tanksim-6e5.6.4) — either revert the deletion or rebuild the test file from the documented scenario specifications. This is required to satisfy the acceptance criterion.","Fix the `make_row()` helper in `calibration_report.rs:205-213` to include the 6 missing ScenarioRow fields so the test compiles. Then verify all calibration_report tests pass including `test_finish_propagates_shared_harness_failures`.","Consider updating `CalibrationRun::finish()` to accept scenario metadata (name, domain, confidence, provenance_status) so that scenarios produced through the calibration workflow carry meaningful metadata rather than empty defaults."],"outcome":"request_changes"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"00541cf1-46b1-4c42-bc27-c0c9aabd822e"}
